def rollback_many(request):
    """G3: submit several independent rollbacks as one ordered batch.

    All or nothing: the items are evaluated in order and the first failing item
    ends the batch with its own code and index, so a batch never reports partial
    results. Items share nothing -- each is evaluated in isolation from its own
    changes, applied journal and retain set, so one item's IDs, replay state and
    budget cannot leak into another's.
