    environment, budget, graph or retain work, so a malformed batch is
    described as such even when an item would also have failed policy. A retry
    is always of an item accepted earlier in the same batch.
    """
    outcomes = []
    first_seen = {}
    for position, item in enumerate(items):
        fault = batch_item_fault(item)
        if fault is not None:
            code, _field = fault
