    """G4: submit several independent rollbacks as one ordered batch.

    All or nothing: the items are processed in request order and the first
    failing item ends the batch with its own code and index, so a batch never
    reports partial results. Items share nothing -- each is evaluated in
    isolation from its own changes, applied journal and retain set, so one
    item's IDs, replay state and budget cannot leak into another's.

