    """G3 batch rollback: one ordered list of independent single-rollback bodies.

    Shape is settled before any business work, in two layers, so the reported
    code says which layer was wrong: envelope problems are `invalid-batch` with a
    null index; malformed elements are `invalid-batch-item` with their real
    index. Only `action` and `requests` are legal on the envelope, and `action`
    must be literal `rollback-many` -- the transport routes here on that value,
    and a direct caller must not reach the batch through another label.

