    The journal already refused `action`, so `operation_id` is the only key that
    must not travel on: it is batch bookkeeping, not part of the rollback the
    single path validates, and leaving it in would make the batch element and
    the equivalent lone request diverge. Everything else is copied so the caller's
    objects are never mutated.
